{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人張智威於節目中推介國泰航空(0293)，指公司未來10年接收150架新飛機拓展航點，中期溢利增長理想，股息率有逾6厘。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">張智威建議13.5元買入，目標價14元，止蝕價12.8元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">張智威：國泰航空(0293)投資策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　$13.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$14</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$12.8</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026mbJBMqBjVp1789705237.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人植耀輝推介中遠海運港口(1199)，指近日股價強勢，8月總吞吐量增長近7%，當中海外碼頭保持強勁。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026rYM3wCJmXN1789705199.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">植耀輝建議5.8元買入，目標價6.25元，止蝕價5.3元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">植耀輝：中遠海運港口(1199)投資策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　$5.8</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$6.25</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$5.3</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026hwj2IkoCqK1789705252.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T04:33:08.186946+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":265,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}